(6748165, 1010255, 96751, '<td valign="top">Basically, a well-framed image, which could nonetheless use some cropping out of the black area.  I don''t know how you processed this but the result of the beach outside is weird and not appealing to me.</td>', 'Basically, a well-framed image, which could nonetheless use some cropping out of the black area.  I don''t know how you processed this but the result of the beach outside is weird and not appealing to me.', '2012-04-21 13:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748169, 1010660, 96751, '<td valign="top">That''s one dangerous light fixture!!!!  What a capture! I actually think you could have cropped out the entire bottom portion and would not have lost anything.</td>', 'That''s one dangerous light fixture!!!!  What a capture! I actually think you could have cropped out the entire bottom portion and would not have lost anything.', '2012-04-21 13:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748172, 1009381, 96751, '<td valign="top">Are you kidding me?????  This is the church I see when I look out MY window. Were you in my house?????? I took a picture of it and will post it after rollover, LOL! You''re across Vermont from us, so it IS slightly different, but still.  WEIRD!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Are you kidding me?????  This is the church I see when I look out MY window. Were you in my house?????? I took a picture of it and will post it after rollover, LOL! You''re across Vermont from us, so it IS slightly different, but still.  WEIRD!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2012-04-21 14:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
